  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Browns Ferry Blues**: back after 100 archived shows (427 days) [9]\n- **Thick as a Brick**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [9]\n- **Fishin Creek Blues**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- **Tom Dooley**: back after 128 archived shows (596 days); rare: 7 archived performances [9]\n- **Billy in the Lowground**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [9]\n- **Mary of the Wild Moor**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- **Ginsing Sullivan**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- **Big Sandy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Dont Let Your Deal Go Down [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-02-16.Flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 46 min; rated 4.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the recording sounds good; Reviewer says the recording sounds great [4][5]\n- **billystrings2019-02-16.mk4v.flac16**: source not stated; 11 songs; 35 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [2]\n- **billystrings2019-02-16.mk4v.flac24**: source not stated; 10 songs; 35 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer praises the McCarter's acoustics and notes Billy performed solo throughout this run of shows [6]\n- Encore was played off stage with Sara and the other women [7]\n- Billy performed alone on stage [8]\n- Encore was with I'm With Her, performed around a single mic at the front of the stage [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-02-16.Flac16**: taped by Josh Haims; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: iPhone x mounted on balcony rail (Facebook Live Audio Stream) [1]. Also: Recorded with an iPhone X on the balcony rail from the Facebook Live audio stream, then PC line out to TASCAM DR-100mkII at 24-bit/48, edited in Audacity, dithered to 16-bit [1]\n- **billystrings2019-02-16.mk4v.flac16**: taped by Timme Newman; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK4V's [2]. Also: Reviewer credits Timme and Keith for getting the recording out quickly [6]\n- **billystrings2019-02-16.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Timme Newman; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK4v>Nbox>M10 [3]",
